  "content": "\n\n<h1>🌍 傳送石</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fwarpstones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/warpstones?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"授權條款\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TtpLXt4.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>📖 說明</h2>\n<p>在世界的關鍵位置放置傳送石，以建立快速旅行節點。本模組專為生存與多人遊戲設計，提供簡單且平衡的快速移動體驗！</p>\n<h3>功能特色</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>自訂名稱（使用命名牌）</li>\n<li>發光效果（使用螢石粉）</li>\n<li>指南針連結</li>\n</ul>\n<p>建議搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flodestone-update-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">磁石配方後置補丁 (Lodestone Recipe Backport)</a> 使用，即可改用鐵錠而非下界合金錠進行製作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🛠️ 合成配方</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C7TvGcL.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>摧毀所有傳送石：</p>\n<pre><code>/function warpstones:destroy_all_warpstones</code></pre>\n<p>取得：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot warpstones:warpstone</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤/問題回報</h2>\n<p>請於 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題、錯誤或缺陷。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">於 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">於 PayPal 贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器架設</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，只需幾下點擊即可擁有專屬伺服器！他們提供全天候客服支援與快速回應服務，確保您的遊玩體驗順暢無阻！有興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器架設\"></p>",
